# Greyson's outro lines, approved by the user as written (2026-09-24, "approve everything so far").
# Said before the fade to the Victory or Defeat screen. player_won: the player beat Greyson (the final brawl's end).
# player_lost: Greyson beat the player, on hearts or with the spirit bomb.

~ player_won
Greyson: No... my cannon... my GAINS...
Greyson: Fine. You win, pal. Computah would've been proud. Probably.
=> END

~ player_lost
Greyson: Told you, pal. Nobody out-hypes me.
Greyson: Computah, buddy... we did it.
=> END
